    <bpmn:process id="W_W1464" name="W1464. Marketplace Product Listing Syndication, Pricing Synchronization &amp; Catalog Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Product price change in ERP; new product activation; product discontinuation; marketplace promotional event
Frequency: Price sync: every 4 hours; New listing: as activated; Catalog audit: monthly
Volume: ~10,000–15,000 active SKUs across Lazada, Shopee, TikTok Shop; ~200–500 price changes/week
Owner: Ecommerce Catalog Specialist
Participants: Ecommerce Catalog Specialist, Category Manager, Pricing Analyst, Ecommerce Operations Manager
Source: workflow W1464 — Marketplace Product Listing Syndication, Pricing Synchronization &amp; Catalog Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1464_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1464_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1464_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1464_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1464_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1464_Lane2" name="Ecommerce Catalog Specialist">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1464_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1464_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1464_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1464_Lane3" name="Pricing Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1464_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1464_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1464_Start5" name="Product price change in ERP; new product activation; product discontinuation; marketplace…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1464_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1464_Task6" name="Automated price sync">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Automated price sync: System pushes price changes from ERP to all marketplaces every 4 hours; logs all changes
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Catalog Specialist
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1464_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1464_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1464_Task7" name="Price conflict monitoring">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Price conflict monitoring: Detect: marketplace price deviates &gt; 2% from ERP; marketplace price below owned ecommerce; price above SRP (RA 7394 risk); alerts for resolution
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Ops Manager
Duration: Automated + 15 min/alert</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1464_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1464_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1464_Task8" name="New product listing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: New product listing: System auto-generates draft; Catalog Specialist enriches per platform; submit for marketplace approval
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Catalog Specialist
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 20–30 min/SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1464_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1464_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1464_Task9" name="Product delisting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Product delisting: Discontinued SKUs set to Inactive (preserve history); remaining inventory evaluated for clearance; once depleted, archived
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Catalog Specialist
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 10 min/SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1464_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1464_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1464_Task10" name="Monthly catalog audit">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Monthly catalog audit: Cross-channel consistency check (titles, descriptions, images, pricing); identify orphan and missing listings; update scorecard
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Catalog Specialist
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Ops Manager
Duration: 4–6 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1464_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1464_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1464_Task11" name="Marketplace margin analysis">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Marketplace margin analysis: Monthly: gross margin per SKU per marketplace (price – COGS – commission 8–15% – fulfillment); recommend channel-specific pricing or exclusions
Responsible (R): Pricing Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1464_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1464_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1464_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1464_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
