        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-271 (ensure controlled execution — Marketplace &amp; Social Commerce (PA-10.3).) | - operational: Ecommerce Catalog Specialist review and approval gate
Owner: Ecommerce Catalog Specialist</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
