    <bpmn:process id="W_W1469" name="W1469. Facebook Marketplace &amp; Community Group Selling Operations, Order Capture &amp; Fulfillment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer inquiry via Facebook Marketplace listing or community buy/sell group; or scheduled community group flash promotion
Frequency: ~50–100 inquiries/store/week via Facebook; ~20–30 converted orders/store/week
Volume: ~200 stores × ~20–30 Facebook-sourced orders/week = ~4,000–6,000 orders/week chain-wide (~17,000–26,000/month; per the Frequency and Time Estimate)
Owner: Sales Associate (Social Commerce)
Participants: Sales Associate, Customer, CSR (order processing), Stock Associate (fulfillment), Marketing (content), Store Manager
Source: workflow W1469 — Facebook Marketplace &amp; Community Group Selling Operations, Order Capture &amp; Fulfillment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1469_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1469_Lane1" name="Sales Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1469_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1469_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1469_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1469_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1469_Lane2" name="CSR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1469_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1469_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1469_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1469_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1469_Start5" name="Customer inquiry via Facebook Marketplace listing or community buy/sell group; or…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1469_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1469_Task6" name="Facebook Marketplace listing management">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Facebook Marketplace listing management: (a) Marketing provides weekly listing templates per store: featured products, promotional pricing, lifestyle images, and product descriptions in Filipino per W1346; (b) Sales Associate posts listings on the store&#x27;s Facebook page and Marketplace: 10–20 product listings per week, rotated based on inventory availability and promotions per W13; (c) Sales Associate monitors and responds to comments and inquiries within 1 hour during business hours; (d) listings include: product photo, price, store location, availability (&quot;Message for stock&quot;), and link to BuildRight ecommerce page for detailed specs
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 30 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1469_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1469_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1469_Task7" name="Community group engagement">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Community group engagement: (a) Sales Associate participates in 3–5 local community buy/sell groups relevant to home improvement: answers product questions, shares BuildRight promotions, posts project tips; (b) when community members post &quot;looking for&quot; requests (e.g., &quot;Where can I find affordable tiles in Cagayan de Oro?&quot;), Sales Associate responds with product availability and pricing; (c) Marketing monitors community group trends and seasonal demand signals (e.g., spike in waterproofing inquiries signals rainy season preparation demand)
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): Marketing
Duration: 20 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1469_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1469_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1469_Task8" name="Messenger order capture">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Messenger order capture: (a) when customer confirms purchase intent via Messenger: Sales Associate creates order in ERP via store operations app &quot;Social Order&quot; function: (i) customer name, phone, delivery preference (BOPIS or delivery), item list, quantity, agreed price; (b) system checks real-time inventory availability at store; (c) system generates order confirmation with order number; (d) Sales Associate sends order confirmation to customer via Messenger with: pickup/delivery instructions, payment options (GCash, cash on pickup, bank transfer); (e) order recorded in sales channel = &quot;Facebook Social&quot; for analytics tracking
Responsible (R): Sales Associate / System
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 10 min/order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1469_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1469_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1469_Task9" name="Payment &amp; fulfillment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Payment &amp; fulfillment: (a) BOPIS: customer arrives at store, presents order number, CSR processes payment at POS per standard W5B, Stock Associate hands over items; (b) Delivery: customer pays via GCash/bank transfer (Sales Associate sends payment link from system), Stock Associate prepares items for delivery per W668 delivery scheduling; (c) for cash-on-delivery: delivery partner collects payment per W668.3 and remits to store; (d) all payment types recorded in POS/ERP for proper revenue recognition and inventory deduction
Responsible (R): CSR / Stock Associate / Sales Associate
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per W5B/W668</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1469_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1469_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1469_Task10" name="Weekly social selling analytics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Weekly social selling analytics: (a) system compiles weekly social selling report per store: inquiries received, conversion rate (inquiries → orders), average order value, top products, customer feedback; (b) Store Manager reviews with Sales Associate: optimize listing strategy, adjust product selection for Facebook audience; (c) Marketing aggregates chain-wide social selling data to measure Facebook channel ROI vs. other channels (Shopee, Lazada, organic ecommerce)
Responsible (R): System / Sales Associate / Marketing
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: 1 hour/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1469_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1469_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1469_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1469_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1469_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-271 (ensure controlled execution — Marketplace &amp; Social Commerce (PA-10.3).) | - operational: social order module and Store Manager oversight; operational: listing templates from Marketing with current pricing; operational: real-time inventory check at order creation
Owner: Sales Associate (Social Commerce)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
