    <bpmn:process id="W_W1470" name="W1470. Marketplace Customer Review Management, Seller Rating Optimization &amp; Dispute Resolution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer posts product review on Shopee/Lazada/TikTok Shop; or BuildRight&#x27;s seller rating drops below 4.5 stars; or marketplace dispute/return request received
Frequency: ~500–800 new reviews/month across all marketplace channels; ~50–80 marketplace disputes/month
Volume: ~42,900 ecommerce orders/month (per model company profile), of which ~30% fulfilled via marketplace = ~12,800 marketplace orders/month generating reviews
Owner: Ecommerce Manager
Participants: Ecommerce Associate, Customer Service Representative, Store Manager (for fulfillment issues), Category Manager (for product quality issues), Vendor (for product defects)
Source: workflow W1470 — Marketplace Customer Review Management, Seller Rating Optimization &amp; Dispute Resolution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1470_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1470_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1470_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1470_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1470_Lane2" name="Ecommerce Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1470_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1470_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1470_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1470_Lane3" name="Ecommerce Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1470_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1470_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1470_Start5" name="Customer posts product review on Shopee/Lazada/TikTok Shop; or BuildRight&#x27;s seller rating…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1470_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1470_Task6" name="Review monitoring &amp; triage">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Review monitoring &amp; triage: (a) system aggregates customer reviews from all marketplace channels (Shopee, Lazada, TikTok Shop) via API integration; (b) Ecommerce Associate reviews incoming reviews daily: (i) Positive (4–5 stars): auto-thank response with loyalty program invitation per W17; (ii) Neutral (3 stars): personalized response acknowledging feedback, offering assistance; (iii) Negative (1–2 stars): escalation to resolution workflow — prioritize by severity (product safety &gt; fulfillment failure &gt; late delivery &gt; minor complaint); (c) weekly: Ecommerce Manager reviews rating trend across all platforms; if any platform rating drops below 4.5 stars, initiate root cause analysis
Responsible (R): System / Ecommerce Associate
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Manager
Duration: 1 hour/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1470_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1470_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1470_Task7" name="Negative review response &amp; resolution">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Negative review response &amp; resolution: For each negative review: (a) Ecommerce Associate investigates: (i) order lookup in ERP — what was ordered, what was shipped, delivery timeline; (ii) root cause categorization: fulfillment error (wrong item, missing parts), product quality (defective, not as described), delivery issue (late, damaged in transit), customer service issue (slow response, unhelpful); (b) Ecommerce Associate responds to customer via marketplace chat within 24 hours: (i) acknowledge the issue, apologize, offer resolution (replacement, refund, store credit), (ii) request customer to update review if issue resolved; (c) for product quality issues: notify Category Manager — if defective product from specific batch, trigger W1347 recall assessment
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Associate / Category Manager
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Manager
Duration: 15 min/review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1470_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1470_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1470_Task8" name="Marketplace dispute &amp; return management">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Marketplace dispute &amp; return management: (a) when customer initiates marketplace return/dispute: system receives dispute notification via API; (b) Ecommerce Associate reviews: (i) is the return valid (product genuinely defective/wrong)? (ii) is the customer a serial returner? (iii) what is the marketplace platform&#x27;s dispute resolution timeline? (c) process return per marketplace rules: (i) approve return and issue refund via marketplace, (ii) customer ships item back or drops at BuildRight store, (iii) Stock Associate inspects returned item and records disposition per W12; (d) dispute resolution within platform SLA (typically 3–5 days) to avoid automatic refund in customer&#x27;s favor
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Associate / CSR
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Manager
Duration: 20 min/dispute</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1470_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1470_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1470_Task9" name="Rating optimization actions">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Rating optimization actions: (a) Ecommerce Manager identifies systemic issues from review patterns: (i) specific store with high fulfillment error rate → Store Manager coaching per W67, (ii) specific product category with quality complaints → Category Manager review vendor quality per W688, (iii) delivery partner with high damage rate → renegotiate or switch partner per W668, (iv) listing accuracy issues (product not as described) → Content Manager update per W50; (b) monthly: Ecommerce Manager compiles marketplace performance report: rating by platform, review response rate and time, dispute resolution rate, NPS by channel
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: 4 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1470_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1470_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1470_Task10" name="Seller metrics compliance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Seller metrics compliance: (a) each marketplace platform has seller performance metrics: response rate (&gt; 90%), ship-on-time rate (&gt; 95%), order cancellation rate (&lt; 5%), dispute rate (&lt; 2%); (b) Ecommerce Associate monitors daily: any metric approaching threshold triggers preventive action; (c) if metric breaches threshold: Ecommerce Manager escalates to VP Marketing for corrective action plan to avoid platform penalties
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Associate / Ecommerce Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: 30 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1470_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1470_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1470_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1470_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1470_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-271 (ensure controlled execution — Marketplace &amp; Social Commerce (PA-10.3).) | - operational: Ecommerce Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Ecommerce Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
